---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { technologyGroups } from '../data/profile';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Rick Allauigan’s progression from backend software engineering toward platform engineering, DevSecOps, and cloud security."
  ><header class="page-header container">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>
      Software engineering beyond the application boundary
    </h1><p class="lede">
      I began in backend engineering, building Go services, APIs, and
      distributed systems. That work led naturally toward the systems
      surrounding application delivery.
    </p>
  </header><article class="prose">
    <h2>Engineering trajectory</h2><p>
      My professional background includes senior software engineering, backend
      team leadership, and project team leadership. I now apply the same habits
      used in application development—versioning, testing, review, automation,
      and observable behavior—to CI/CD, containers, Kubernetes, infrastructure,
      and security controls.
    </p><h2>Current direction</h2><p>
      My focus is platform engineering, DevSecOps, cloud security, and security
      automation. This portfolio documents that progression through designs and
      labs, clearly distinguishing established backend experience from
      capabilities still being developed.
    </p><h2>Technology context</h2>{
      technologyGroups.map((group) => (
        <section>
          <>
            <h3>{group.title}</h3>
            <ul>
              {group.items.map((item) => (
                <li>{item}</li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </>
        </section>
      ))
    }
  </article></BaseLayout
>
